WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Pre-mission NASA animation of InSight’s planned instrument deployment.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The articulated arm moves a science instrument toward the illustrated Martian ground.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
This is a visualization of the design, not footage of the actual deployment on Mars.
